{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-curated role overrides for cards the heuristics get wrong.",
    "Keyed by exact card name rather than oracle_id: names are unique in",
    "Scryfall's oracle_cards file and are far easier to maintain by hand.",
    "Unknown names are reported by `manage.py classify_cards` rather than",
    "failing silently, so typos surface.",
    "",
    "Format: \"Card Name\": [\"primary\", \"secondary\"]  (secondary may be \"\")",
    "",
    "Roles: land ramp draw spot_removal sweeper tutor recursion protection",
    "       wincon synergy"
  ],

  "_always_include_comment": [
    "Cards strong enough to run in essentially any deck regardless of score.",
    "The solver may treat these as auto-includes when budget permits."
  ],
  "_always_include": [
    "Sol Ring",
    "Arcane Signet",
    "Command Tower"
  ],

